 "sentences": [
  "Tiny space rocks are remembering their history.",
  "NASA’s Hubble and Webb telescopes just spotted 27 faint, icy objects beyond Neptune.",
  "These are some of the smallest, dimmest bodies ever seen in our solar system.",
  "Surprisingly, these tiny rocks look exactly like their larger family members.",
  "This suggests they haven't changed much since the solar system first formed.",
  "They are effectively preserving a frozen record of planet-building."
